{"script":"wt_c2_07_1_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]太棒了！这东西一看威力就非常大！太感谢了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]哼……这些红晶再硬，也抵不住爆炸的威力吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]我已经迫不及待想要看见，那些困扰我们的红晶被这东西炸上天了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]说起来……我们得躲多远呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]太近就会炸伤自己，太远就没法欣赏到爆炸了……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]真是的……考虑这些做什么，那些红水晶不过是路上的阻碍罢了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]真正辛苦的工作，还是后面的挖矿啊……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"“石头”的请求"}